<title>BELGIUM: Brussels bourse suspends Olivetti shares.</title>
<headline>Brussels bourse suspends Olivetti shares.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brussels Stock Exchange said on Wednesday it would suspend trade in shares in Italian electronics group Ing C Olivetti &amp; Co SpA until 1000 GMT in line with a move by Milan's bourse to delay trade in the company.</p>
<p>The Brussels bourse said it would also cancel for one day the morning price fixing applied to Olivetti shares on Brussels' cash market.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
